{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/thm-q-bkm","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Theorem","doco:Section"],"label":"thm:q-bkm","kind":"theorem","title":"$q$-deformed Beale--Kato--Majda criterion","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-ns-nonlinear-uniqueness"],"tags":["BKM","blowup-criterion","vorticity","regularity"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.FluidDynamics.q_bkm_criterion","text":"q-bkm-criterion.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"thm:q-bkm\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">v</code> be the solution of the q-NS system with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q > 1</code> on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[0, T)</code> and let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\omega_q = d_q v</code> be the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-vorticity. Then <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">v</code> extends smoothly beyond <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T</code> if and only if <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\int_0^T \\lVert \\omega_q(t) \\rVert_{L^\\infty}dt &#x3C; \\infty</code>.</p>\n<p>Since well-posedness solutions are global for <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q > 1</code>, the integral is always finite when <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q > 1</code>. The criterion becomes non-trivial only in the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\to 1</code> limit.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/q-bkm-criterion.md","heading":"Theorem","number":"20.4.9","page":"b/thm-q-bkm","qa":{"counts":{"pass":89,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":74},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.FluidDynamics.q_bkm_criterion","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/q_bkm_criterion.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
